<title>FRANCE: W.Bank lends Algeria $89 million for jobs.</title>
<headline>W.Bank lends Algeria $89 million for jobs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank lent Algeria $89 million to finance employment-intensive projects in rural communities, said Algerian state-run radio on Friday.</p>
<p>More than two million people are out of work from Algeria's nearly six-million workforce.</p>
